&lt;li&gt;Partner with editorial team to ensure content (e.g. image selection and text) is appropriate for each product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in providing direction to marketing on product promotion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and liaise with licensors to implement a smooth approvals process for the projects that you are working on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Manager to create go-to-market strategy for key releases&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive knowledge of baseball&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of collectibles category &amp;amp; license trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in fast-paced team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to multi-task and prioritize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and strong organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong computer skills – Word, PowerPoint and Excel essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills – written and oral&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative and strategic thinking abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2-3 years brand or product development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumer products or collectables experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
