&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concept Artist — Fanatics TCG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is building the next generation of trading card games.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Fanatics TCG studio is creating original worlds designed to live for decades — expressed through gameplay, art, story, and collectible objects. Our ambition is to build franchises that are not only widely played, but deeply loved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Concept Artist&lt;/strong&gt; to help define the visual identity of these worlds from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a role for an artist who wants to help&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;invent worlds&lt;/strong&gt; — to establish the look, tone, and emotional resonance of new universes, and to create imagery that becomes foundational to a franchise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will work closely with Creative, Design, and Product leadership to shape the earliest visual explorations of characters, cultures, environments, and moments — helping answer not just&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;what things look like&lt;/em&gt;, but&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;what they feel like&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate brings a strong point of view, exceptional craft, and a desire to create work that endures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the Visual Identity of New Worlds&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Create concept art that establishes the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;tone, mood, and visual language&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of new TCG franchises.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Explore and iterate on visual directions that define&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;what makes a world distinct, memorable, and ownable&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the creation of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;iconic characters, factions, creatures, and environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Work That Shapes a Franchise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop imagery that becomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;foundational reference for the entire art pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Help establish the visual standards that guide internal teams and external artists.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Create work that is not only functional, but&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;evocative, inspiring, and collectible in its own right&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate at the Earliest Stages of Creation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Creative and Design leadership during&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;ideation and worldbuilding&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Help translate abstract ideas into&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;clear, compelling visual direction&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Engage in creative exploration — pushing beyond the first idea to find the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;most interesting one&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Rapid prototyping – be able to switch into rough sketch and concept work when needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Taste and Craft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bring a strong artistic point of view and contribute to the studio’s overall&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;creative bar&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Help shape the visual culture of the team through feedback, references, and collaboration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Continuously refine work toward&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;clarity, originality, and emotional impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A portfolio that demonstrates&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;exceptional taste, craft, and originality&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strength in one or more areas such as&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;character design, creature design, or environment design&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to contribute broadly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;composition, lighting, color, and visual storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to explore multiple directions and converge on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;clear, compelling solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong collaboration skills and comfort working in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;early-stage, ambiguous creative spaces&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A genuine passion for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;fantasy, sci-fi, games, and worldbuilding&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience contributing to the development of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;original IP or franchise worlds&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Background in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;games, film, publishing, or other visual storytelling mediums&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with how concept art translates into&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;final production pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience collaborating with or guiding&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;external artists and partners&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Fanatics TCG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is building the future of fandom.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Fanatics TCG studio is a rare opportunity to create new worlds at scale — worlds that will be expressed through millions of physical objects, shared across global communities, and evolved over many years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Concept Artist, your work will help define the foundation of these worlds — shaping the images that players and collectors return to again and again.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you want to build something enduring, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to Seattle and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Seattle Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$88,550&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is seeking&amp;nbsp;an experienced Consolidation &amp;amp; Reporting Manager to support the International Finance team during the implementation of Oracle ERP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role supporting the international consolidation, month-end close and reporting processes while also providing accounting and reporting support throughout the Oracle implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will work closely with the International Finance team and support the Oracle solution design, account and reporting mappings, data migration, testing, reconciliation, go-live and post-implementation stabilisation activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will work across our international entities and collaborate closely with Controllership, FP&amp;amp;A, Tax, Treasury, Systems, the Oracle implementation team and local finance teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consolidation and reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the International Finance team with the monthly close and reporting process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review entity submissions, consolidation journals, intercompany balances and eliminations, foreign currency translation and consolidated results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the technical upload of local reporting packages into FCC, including validating submitted data and resolving upload or mapping issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the investigation and resolution of consolidation and reporting variances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure that reporting submissions are complete, accurate and delivered in line with group deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify, standardise and automate consolidation and reporting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oracle ERP implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design and implementation of Oracle ERP accounting, close, consolidation and reporting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in Oracle design sessions and help translate International Finance requirements into practical system solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review proposed process designs and configurations to ensure they meet international accounting, reporting and statutory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design, preparation and validation of:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chart-of-accounts mappings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;legal entity and reporting structures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;financial statement and management reporting hierarchies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;intercompany mappings and elimination rules;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;legacy system-to-Oracle mappings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;cost centre, department, product and other reporting dimensions; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;accounting rules and close processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data cleansing, migration and validation, including reconciling opening balances and historical data between legacy systems and Oracle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop finance test scenarios and support system integration testing and user acceptance testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform detailed testing of accounting entries, close processes, consolidation outputs, reports and system interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document test results, raise and track defects, and work with the project team to resolve identified issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess the accounting and reporting impact of system or process gaps and support the development of practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the preparation of standardised close procedures, reporting templates, controls, process documentation and user guidance for the Oracle environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on support during cutover, go-live and the post-implementation stabilisation period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure that close, consolidation and reporting deadlines continue to be met throughout the Oracle implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in financial consolidation, group reporting and month-end close within a complex multinational organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical experience using &lt;strong&gt;Oracle ERP, ideally Oracle Fusion, including financial close and reporting processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience supporting an Oracle or similar ERP implementation, including design workshops, mappings, data migration and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of consolidation accounting, including intercompany eliminations, foreign currency translation and multi-entity reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing or reviewing financial reporting under US GAAP and/or IFRS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of financial controls, balance sheet reconciliations and audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills and confidence working with large and complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and the ability to identify inconsistencies across systems, mappings and reporting outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage competing priorities and deliver high-quality work within demanding close and implementation timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to work effectively with stakeholders across multiple countries and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience with D365, FCC, Hyperion, TM1 or other consolidation and reporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across EMEA and APAC entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with statutory reporting and the coordination of international external audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Oracle reporting tools and integrations between Oracle and consolidation or planning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within a fast-growing consumer products, retail, e-commerce, licensing or collectibles business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract term&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is initially a &lt;strong&gt;12-month fixed-term contract&lt;/strong&gt; covering the Oracle ERP implementation, testing, go-live and stabilisation period. There may be potential for extension depending on the implementation timeline and ongoing business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above list of job duties is not exclusive or exhaustive and the post holder will be required to undertake such tasks as may reasonably be expected within the scope and grading of the post.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
