&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fanatics Collectibles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is the home of sports cards, trading cards, and collectibles for over 100 million fans worldwide. As part of the global Fanatics platform, we&#39;re rebuilding how collectors discover, buy, sell, and experience their hobby with world class technology and product experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Fanatics Collectibles’ continued global growth, we are establishing a new technology hub in Mexico City focused on operational excellence, platform scalability, trust, and customer experience. This team partners closely with Customer Experience (CX), Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Fraud Prevention, Payments, and Financial Operations organizations to build scalable systems and operational tooling that support millions of users and transactions globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Engineer II, you will help scale and evolve our data infrastructure as we build greenfield systems and develop a modern, cloud-native data stack. This FTE role will be primarily dedicated to &lt;strong&gt;supporting the Topps data engineering platform&lt;/strong&gt;. You will also contribute to &lt;strong&gt;Snowflake architecture, modeling, and optimization&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring strong foundations for analytics, business intelligence, and operational data products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, deploy, and maintain components of cloud-native data pipelines, integrating a variety of structured and unstructured data sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize data models in relational and NoSQL databases to support scalable data access patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and monitor data quality, observability, and reliability checks using modern best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and enhance Snowflake data modeling for Topps-related datasets and analytics pipelines via Shopify APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and enhance Terraform project for Snowflake RBAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with data engineers, analysts, product managers, and business stakeholders to understand data needs and deliver usable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews (Gand adopt engineering standards aligned to a high-performing data engineering culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to onboarding and documentation of data sources, transformations, and pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously learn and adapt new technologies to improve system performance and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in data engineering or software engineering roles with a focus on backend data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in **Python** , **SQL** , and **dbt** for data manipulation and pipeline development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with **Shopify** APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Snowflake including performance tuning, schema design, and query optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (AWS preferred), and tools like Lambda, S3, Glue, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with distributed data processing tools (e.g., Spark, Airflow) and modern orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of both SQL and NoSQL databases and data modeling techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced environment with iterative product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Code-Writing Contribution&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on engineering role. A successful TP2 Data Engineer will be expected to regularly write clean, maintainable code to support ingestion pipelines, transformation logic, and data validation. Contributions are typically reviewed by senior engineers and integrated into production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fanatics Collect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collect is redefining the trading card industry, connecting passionate collector communities with the products they love. We&#39;re backed by Fanatics — a $31B company and the world&#39;s largest sports merchandiser, with 900+ sports relationships and exclusive MLB, NFL, and NBA licensing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commerce engine spans three connected marketplaces: Fanatics Live (live breaking, buy-now and auction), the Fanatics Collect Marketplace (our secondary marketplace and auction house), and TOPPS.com (primary market e-commerce for new releases and drops).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a distributed team across time zones and countries. We hire for intelligence and kindness, value context over control, and expect ownership — hands-on, decisive, comfortable with ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the future of the Fanatics Collect Marketplace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Fanatics Collect Marketplace is our secondary marketplace and auction house — the trusted, always-on venue collectors rely on to buy and sell at scale, spanning Buy Now fixed-price listings and ongoing Weekly and Premier Auctions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Design Lead to own this experience end to end: making it the most enjoyable, the most trusted, the most engaging, and the easiest way for collectors to find and buy the cards they&#39;re looking for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with the Director of Product Design, Fanatics Collect E-commerce, and with the design leads for Fanatics Live and TOPPS.com, so the Marketplace feels like one part of a single, coherent Fanatics Collect experience — not a separate product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplace Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end design of the Fanatics Collect Marketplace — Buy Now, Weekly Auctions, and Premier Auctions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make it the easiest way to find the card a collector is looking for — search, browse, filtering, and discovery that scale as the marketplace grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the trust and transparency collectors expect from the world&#39;s leading auction house for trading cards — clear listings, clear provenance, clear outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance the distinct mechanics of fixed-price buying and live/ongoing auctions within one coherent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to raise the bar on usability, hierarchy, and interaction patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement &amp;amp; Trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the moments that make bidding, buying, and selling feel exciting, not stressful — anticipation without anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion clarity and transparency at every step: pricing, fees, authentication, and order status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and collector feedback to continuously improve conversion, trust, and satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Surface Coherence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Live/Breaking and TOPPS.com design leads so shared patterns — search, navigation, checkout — feel consistent across all three surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Creative Studio so the Marketplace reflects Fanatics Collect&#39;s trusted, auction-house brand voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Shared Experience team on the design system, search, and navigation patterns the Marketplace depends on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold a high craft bar — every listing, every card, every transaction should feel worthy of what collectors love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push quality from concept through shipped execution, partnering closely with Engineering to preserve design intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other designers and help raise the craft standard across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of product design experience, ideally including marketplace, e-commerce, or auction/commerce design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker who can design for both fast, fixed-price buying and the anticipation of live auctions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable moving from user flows and information architecture to detailed UI and interaction design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-informed: you use research and metrics to drive decisions, not just instinct.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear communicator who can align Product, Engineering, Brand, and adjacent design leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine appreciation for the trading card and collecting hobby, or real excitement to dive in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don&#39;t tick every box, talk to us anyway. We know the &quot;perfect candidate&quot; doesn&#39;t exist, and we want people who bring their own perspective to Fanatics Collect.&lt;/p&gt;
