&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of Physical Product Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;On-site in Dallas, Texas; or possibly New York, Florida, or California | Reports to VP of Global Security&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a newly created, senior leadership role responsible for building and owning the global physical product security strategy across the company&#39;s collectible trading card business. The Director will define how the organization protects its products — from ideation and product development, through manufacturing, packing and distribution, retail, and vaulting operations — and will serve as the internal authority on product security risk, standards, and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Design and implement a comprehensive global physical product security framework covering product design and anti-counterfeiting measures, manufacturing, packing, warehousing, shipping and fulfillment, and proprietary retail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Partner on loss prevention strategy across all channels, with accountability for shrinkage targets globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Develop and enforce product security standards, policies, and operating procedures across all regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Partner with supply chain, operations, retail, and e-commerce leadership to embed security controls into business processes without disrupting commercial performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Build a comprehensive anti-counterfeiting program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Lead threat and risk assessments — including on third-party manufacturing, counterfeiting, product tampering, pack searching, internal theft, and organized retail crime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Report regularly to the VP of Global Security and senior leadership on risk posture, incidents, and strategic initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; 10+ years in physical security, with at least 5 years in a management or leadership role within a high-value consumer goods, luxury product, collectibles, technology, or comparable environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Proven track record designing and executing enterprise-wide product security programs across multiple geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Strong ability to identify security risks across product lifecycles - from ideation through manufacturing, packing, shipping and retail - and propose practical solutions for risk mitigation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Deep expertise in anti-counterfeiting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Deep expertise in loss prevention and supply chain security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Strong cross-functional influencer — able to align security objectives with business priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Experience managing global teams across diverse regulatory and cultural environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Certifications such as CPP (Certified Protection Professional) or PSP (Physical Security Professional) are a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Willingness to travel up to 50%, with occasional travel up to 75%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to New York City and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NYC Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,750&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
