&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Editor, Basketball supports the end-to-end editorial process for assigned trading card projects, working closely with Editorial leadership, Product Development, Art, Project Management, and production partners to deliver accurate, compelling, and innovative collectible products. This role combines editorial content development, photography selection, subject-list management, proofing, and Basketball subject-matter knowledge within a deadline-driven production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editorial &amp;amp; Content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select, assign, and crop high-quality photography appropriate to product design, licensing requirements, and brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate text- and statistics-based card-back content for collectible trading card products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and update subject lists in partnership with Product Development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review editorial content, proofs, and layouts for accuracy, consistency, and completeness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply established licensor style guides, editorial standards, and internal quality requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify photography acquisition needs and communicate requests in support of production schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with internal stakeholders and external content, imaging, and prepress partners throughout the production and correction process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete assigned work in accordance with established project schedules, priorities, and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and escalate issues involving editorial content, imagery, licensing, or production workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate project information and status updates within applicable content-management and workflow systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate proactively with Editorial leadership and cross-functional partners when information, assets, or approvals are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in product reviews and brainstorming sessions for assigned programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Development and Art to contribute editorial, imagery, and Basketball-specific perspective to product concepts and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
