&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company working at the intersection of collectibles and technology. Backed by some of the best investors, sports properties, and operators in the world, we’re integrating with Fanatics’ global digital sports platform (inclusive of 900 sports relationships and more than 80 million fans) to reimagine the collectibles business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Graphic Designer II at Fanatics Collectibles, you will play a key role in developing high-quality visual designs across various product lines and marketing initiatives. This mid-level position requires strong conceptual thinking, multi-tasking abilities, and technical expertise, ensuring the successful execution of designs from concept to final production. You will work closely with Art Directors, Senior Designers, and cross-functional teams to elevate the creative output while contributing to design direction, problem-solving, and workflow improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Execution &amp;amp; Design Development&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop visually compelling designs for trading card products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-quality visual assets for trading cards, branding, and marketing campaigns assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and refine typography, color palettes, and layouts to enhance storytelling and product appeal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce production-ready files with a deep understanding of print and digital specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide creative solutions that enhance product differentiation and collector engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribution to Creative Direction&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer design insights and strategic input to elevate brand aesthetics and product positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to brainstorming sessions, providing innovative and trend-forward design concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with sports, pop culture, collectibles, and industry trends to inform creative strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Art Directors, Senior Designers, Marketing, Product Development, and Licensing teams to ensure design excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present design ideas and rationale to stakeholders, incorporating feedback effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide creative mentorship and guidance to junior designers, helping to elevate overall team output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Tasking &amp;amp; Workflow Management&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, meeting tight deadlines while maintaining design integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term production needs with long-term creative innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt quickly to project shifts, feedback, and fast-paced workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Control &amp;amp; Brand Consistency&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all design assets maintain a high standard of quality, accuracy, and brand consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough reviews of designs before production, addressing potential issues proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement best practices in file organization, asset management, and workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Graphic Design, Fine Arts, or a related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in graphic design, with a strong portfolio demonstrating branding, typography, layout, and storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing creativity, typography, color theory, layout, and branding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of print production, digital design principles, and brand identity development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, time management, and multi-tasking skills in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, with a commitment to producing high-quality work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and ability to work collaboratively in a team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for sports, collectibles, and design is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to New York City and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NYC Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$69,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$80,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphic Designers at Fanatics Collectibles create new and notable collectibles daily, leveraging industry-standard software and a graphic artist’s toolkit to produce original trading card designs that build brands and excite consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within Special Projects and supports priority initiatives that require fast, high-craft execution across concept development and production-ready deliverables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop review-ready card art and promotional concepts aligned to brand and style guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute complex image treatments including retouch/cleanup, recombination, and compositing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver prepress/print-ready files for digital and off-set press workflows, leveraging strong production discipline and file hygiene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and manipulate graphics using Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incorporate direction from Art Directors and senior designers into finished design work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Development, Production/Prepress, and Project Management to prioritize work and hit deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear versioning and documentation through review rounds, applying feedback quickly and accurately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create polished design mockups for partner- and stakeholder-facing slide decks, ensuring concepts are clear, accurate, on-brand, and presentation-ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You are:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative, enthusiastic, and eager to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Adobe Creative Cloud apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert in layout, typography, and color theory&lt;/li&gt;
