&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Growth Marketing Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to drive customer acquisition, engagement and revenue growth for Fanatics Collect in Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to our Germany Country Lead, this is a hands-on, in-market role responsible for developing and executing a locally relevant growth strategy. You’ll turn product launches, sporting and cultural moments, customer insights and market trends into high-impact campaigns across acquisition, CRM, lifecycle, creators and partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with our central Growth team—spanning paid marketing, lifecycle and influencer marketing—to bring global expertise and playbooks into Germany. You’ll ensure campaigns are effectively localized, identify new opportunities specific to the German market and share insights that can shape our wider growth strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits someone with real startup energy: commercially minded, highly analytical and comfortable moving between strategy and execution. You’ll be able to identify what needs to be done and make it happen—whether that means building a local growth plan, briefing a campaign, launching an experiment, developing a creator partnership or digging into performance data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Growth Marketing in Germany&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the local growth marketing strategy for Germany, focused on customer acquisition, engagement, retention and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the German marketing calendar, turning product launches, sporting and cultural moments, and seasonal cycles into compelling, well-executed campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and deliver integrated campaigns across paid, CRM, lifecycle, creators, partnerships and community channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate German customer insights and market trends into clear growth opportunities and campaign ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Country Lead and Account Management team to align marketing activity with seller priorities and wider commercial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure global brand and product campaigns are effectively adapted for German audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Acquisition and Lifecycle Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the central Growth team to develop locally relevant customer acquisition campaigns across paid and organic channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and coordinate CRM and lifecycle activity for German customers, including onboarding, activation, retention and re-engagement campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve the customer journey and increase conversion, repeat purchase and long-term value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop audience segments, messaging and offers based on customer behaviour and market insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run tests across channels, content, messaging and promotions, using results to continually improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Creators, Content and Partnerships as Growth Channels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and manage relationships with relevant German creators, communities and commercial partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop campaigns and content that grow awareness, engagement and customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build partnerships around key sporting, cultural and collectible moments that strengthen our presence in Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-performing local content and campaign ideas that could be scaled across other markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and Optimize Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track key growth metrics across acquisition, activation, engagement, retention and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor campaign and channel performance, translating data into clear actions and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use experimentation, customer insights and performance analysis to determine where to invest and what to improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share German market learnings with central teams to help shape wider strategy, tools and playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear updates on performance, priorities and upcoming growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–6 years of experience in growth marketing, performance marketing, lifecycle marketing or a broader commercial marketing role, ideally within e-commerce, marketplaces, live commerce, media or entertainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and strong working English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing campaigns across multiple growth channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the customer funnel, from acquisition and activation through to engagement and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-comfortable, with the ability to track performance, run experiments and optimize activity based on results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts and an understanding of how marketing activity translates into revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who can identify priorities and execute independently without needing a fully defined brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable owning a broad and evolving remit in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with creators, influencers, communities or commercial partners is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for sports, collectibles or the wider hobby is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. This salary range is specific to Frankfurt and may not be applicable to other locations. When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Frankfurt Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€56.906&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€88.204 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
