&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain production logs and quality inspections.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
