&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of guillotine safety and precision cutting methods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
