&lt;li&gt;Highly autonomous, proactive and results oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of local consumer behavior, cultural trends and retail landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate global and regional strategies into effective local marketing plans and activations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for sports, entertainment, trading cards and/or collectibles, and an understanding of fan and collector culture, is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
