&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;1-3 years of experience in physical security, law enforcement, military, or a related field preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
