&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Press Technician to maintain, repair, and troubleshoot Heidelberg offset printing presses. The ideal candidate has hands-on mechanical, electrical, and pneumatic troubleshooting experience with Heidelberg equipment and a strong understanding of press systems and preventive maintenance practices. This role is critical to maximizing press uptime, extending equipment life, and ensuring presses run at peak performance for the production team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and repair mechanical, electrical, and pneumatic issues on Heidelberg offset presses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform scheduled preventive maintenance, including lubrication, calibration, and inspection of press components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve press downtime issues quickly to minimize impact on production schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspect, adjust, and replace worn or damaged parts (rollers, bearings, gears, belts, cylinders, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and calibrate press control systems and consoles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Heidelberg service representatives or outside vendors for major repairs, parts orders, or warranty work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate maintenance logs, repair records, and parts usage documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct root-cause analysis on recurring mechanical failures and recommend corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with safety protocols, including lockout/tagout procedures and proper handling of lubricants, solvents, and chemicals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an organized inventory of spare parts, tools, and maintenance supplies; notify supervisors of reorder needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support press operators by responding promptly to mechanical issues during production runs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clean, organized, and safe maintenance work area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of hands-on experience maintaining and repairing offset printing presses, preferably Heidelberg equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mechanical aptitude with proven troubleshooting skills across mechanical, electrical, and pneumatic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of offset press components and their function within the printing process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read schematics, wiring diagrams, and technical service manuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hand tools, power tools, and precision measuring instruments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of electrical systems (motors, sensors, control panels) and pneumatic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift up to 50 lbs, work in confined spaces, and stand/kneel for extended periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heidelberg factory training or certification in press maintenance/service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining multiple press configurations (multi-color units, UV coating units, perfecting presses)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PLC systems or press control diagnostics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual (English/Spanish) a plus, depending on shop needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Work Environment&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pressroom and maintenance shop environment with exposure to noise, machinery, lubricants, and solvents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use of PPE (safety glasses, hearing protection, gloves) required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May require shift work, including evenings, weekends, or on-call emergency repair support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Process Engineer will serve as the technical bridge between manufacturing operations and automated equipment throughout its lifecycle — from initial concept and vendor selection through design, build, installation, and steady-state production. This role is responsible for deeply understanding new automated/semi-automated equipment during the purchase and design phase, representing process and operator requirements in equipment specifications, and leading or supporting deployment activities to ensure the machine meets safety, quality, throughput, and reliability objectives. The Process Engineer will also develop and refine standard operating procedures, work instructions, and process parameters for the equipment, and will analyze current processes to identify improvement opportunities that inform capital project justifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equipment Purchase &amp;amp; Design Phase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with equipment vendors and internal stakeholders (engineering, quality, maintenance, EHS, operations) during the design and specification phase of new automated equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and review User Requirement Specifications (URS), Functional Design Specifications (FDS), and technical requirements to ensure equipment will meet process, quality, ergonomic, and safety needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate vendor proposals and machine designs (mechanical, controls, PLC/HMI logic, fixturing, tooling, material handling) for technical soundness, manufacturability, and fit with existing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design reviews, risk assessments (PFMEA, machine risk assessment), and layout/ergonomic evaluations prior to build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and document process, tooling, and facility requirements (utilities, footprint, fixturing, material flow) needed to support the new equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the technical and financial justification for capital projects by quantifying current-state process limitations (cycle time, scrap, labor, downtime, ergonomics) and projected improvements from automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Deployment &amp;amp; Commissioning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent process engineering on cross-functional project teams from kickoff through handover to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT) at the vendor site and Site Acceptance Testing (SAT) after installation to confirm the equipment meets contractual and process specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support installation, rigging, utility hook-up coordination, and startup activities in collaboration with maintenance/facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive equipment qualification activities (IQ/OQ/PQ, capability studies, Gage R&amp;amp;R) as applicable to confirm the machine consistently produces to specification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track open issues, punch lists, and vendor commitments through resolution, ensuring root-cause closure of any performance gaps identified during ramp-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate training for operators, technicians, and maintenance staff on new equipment operation and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Development &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study current manual, semi-automated, or legacy processes to understand process flow, cycle times, failure modes, and constraints as input to automation project scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, document, and maintain Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), work instructions, control plans, and process parameter sheets for new and existing equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modify or optimize existing processes/equipment settings to improve safety, quality, cycle time, uptime, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or support root cause analysis and corrective actions for equipment/process-related quality or downtime issues (e.g., 8D, 5-Why, fishbone).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Lean/Six Sigma and continuous improvement methods to identify and eliminate waste, and to build the business case for future automation investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain process documentation, control plans, and PFMEAs in alignment with quality system requirements (e.g., IATF16949, ISO9001, as applicable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustaining Support &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing engineering support for automated equipment post-launch, including troubleshooting, minor design modifications, and performance monitoring (OEE, downtime, scrap trends).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with maintenance/controls engineering on preventive maintenance plans, spare parts strategy, and obsolescence management for new equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with EHS to ensure machine guarding, lockout/tagout, and safety systems meet regulatory and company standards before and after deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate project status, risks, and equipment performance to engineering leadership and plant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Mechanical, Industrial, Manufacturing, Electrical, or a related Engineering discipline (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–7+ years of process/manufacturing engineering experience, with direct involvement in automated equipment specification, procurement, or deployment (adjust range per level).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing or reviewing URS/FDS documents and participating in FAT/SAT is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of automation fundamentals: PLC/HMI logic, robotics, vision systems, sensors, conveyance, and basic controls concepts (programming not always required, but literacy expected).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with machine safety standards (e.g., ANSI B11, OSHA, NFPA 79, or regional equivalents) and risk assessment methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with CAD software (SolidWorks, AutoCAD, or similar) for reviewing layouts and fixture/tooling designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with process capability and quality tools: PFMEA, control plans, SPC, Gage R&amp;amp;R, root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Office/Excel; experience with project management tools (MS Project, Smartsheet) a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean Manufacturing / Six Sigma exposure (Green Belt or higher preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to manage multiple concurrent equipment projects and vendor relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate operator/process needs into clear technical specifications for equipment vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills; comfortable building data-driven justifications for capital investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written and verbal communication skills across engineering, operations, and leadership audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, floor-based approach — comfortable working on the shop floor with operators, technicians, and vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants. Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;For more than 40 years, GC Packaging (the &quot;Company&quot;) has been an innovator in the card manufacturing industry. We offer our clients a comprehensive mix of special effects finishing, collating, and packaging techniques to make even the most challenging of projects come to life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Operations Leader, the Process Improvement Manager will be responsible for delivering improvement in safety, quality, cost and customer service across manufacturing and distribution operations. This role is expected to learn and understand the trading card manufacturing process and get involved with day-to-day operations at the facility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop process documentation and standard work procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support process and value stream mapping activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and lead process improvement activities across manufacturing and distribution operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define labor and cost standards for various processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Investigate new technologies &amp;amp; equipment to improve process efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work with the production and maintenance teams to commission new equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead root cause analysis and problem-solving sessions to address issues related to safety, quality and delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support training of hourly and salary team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Track performance to KPIs and report on variances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Execute other tasks in support of facility operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelors degree in Engineering, Operations Management or other relevant field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bilingual, fluent in English and Spanish&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lean/Six Sigma certification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;2+ years of work experience in manufacturing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Job Knowledge, Skills and Abilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of CI systems and methodologies including TPM, Lean, Six Sigma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong Excel ability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills, ability to present ideas to a diverse audience from hourly workforce to executive leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead teams, manage cross-functional projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of EHS, quality, manufacturing, warehousing and distribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to analyze and solve complex problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Physical Demands:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work is performed in an administrative office setting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Must be flexible and available to work extended hours when necessary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prolonged periods sitting at a desk and working on a computer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Product Strategy Manager to help define the structure and evolution of trading card products across the Topps portfolio. Sitting at the intersection of Strategy and Product Development, this role uses brand standards, product-performance data, collector insights, retailer feedback, and market trends to build the initial blueprint for products across multiple brands and sports. The Product Strategy Manager will help determine how core product elements fit together, establish consistency and complexity guardrails, and lead cross-functional alignment before products move into detailed development and creative execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a structured, highly analytical operator who can translate data and strategy into clear product recommendations and detailed frameworks. They bring experience in product management or development, business analytics, management consulting, strategic operations, or a related field, along with strong executive communication and the ability to influence across teams. Familiarity with physical consumer products, trading cards, collectibles, or other fandom-driven categories is strongly preferred, as is the judgment to distinguish personal preferences from evidence about what collectors and the market value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing the initial blueprint of Products across several Topps portfolios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting Product Architecture meetings – validating the initial Product Build against brand standardization guidelines before handoff to the Product Development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Product Strategy, Creative, and Product Development teams to deliver the highest quality of product deliverables consistently across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a champion of Brand standardization and consistency across a broad portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Product Strategy team to analyze collector insights, market data, retailer feedback, and industry trends to inform product decisions and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help drive Quarterly Brand Reviews to review brand performance, collector insights, insert ecosystems, and innovation opportunities for the upcoming year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-10 years of experience in Product Development, Product Management, Business Analytics, Management Consulting or Strategic Ops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency in Microsoft Office (Outlook, Excel, PowerPoint, BI), AI tools (Claud, Chat GPT, etc.) and comfort learning new internal technology tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, highly organized, and able to thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working cross-functionally across different teams, managing senior stakeholders across global organizations, and delivering executive-level presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, capable of engaging senior leaders, cross-functional teams, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in developing innovative physical products; trading card or collectibles experience strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, marketing, or related field; MBA a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for trading cards, collectibles, and fan culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants. Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to New York City and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NYC Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$135,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$165,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a leading producer and seller of physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and collectibles across sports and entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Topps&lt;/strong&gt; is one of the most recognized names in trading cards and collecting, with a heritage spanning generations of collectors across sports and entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fanatics Live&lt;/strong&gt; brings together content, community, and commerce through creator-led live shopping experiences where fans and collectors can discover products, participate in live breaks, and connect around shared interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fanatics Collect&lt;/strong&gt; gives collectors a place to shop, sell, vault, and manage their collections, bringing multiple parts of the collecting experience together in one platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, these businesses are creating new ways for fans and collectors to connect with the sports, athletes, entertainment, and collectibles they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is looking for a curious, collaborative, and craft-focused &lt;strong&gt;Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to help create engaging digital experiences across &lt;strong&gt;Topps, Fanatics Live, and Fanatics Collect&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll work alongside product designers, product managers, engineers, researchers, marketers, and creative partners to turn ideas and user needs into intuitive, engaging product experiences for fans and collectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll contribute throughout the design process—from exploring concepts and user flows to creating polished interfaces and supporting implementation. You’ll also partner closely with our Graphic Designer to bring together product usability and strong visual storytelling, helping create cohesive experiences across our products and brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity for a designer who is building their product design career and wants hands-on experience working across digital products at the intersection of sports, collecting, community, content, and commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Fanatics Collectibles’ continued global growth, we are establishing a new technology hub in Mexico City focused on operational excellence, platform scalability, trust, and customer experience. This team partners closely with Customer Experience (CX), Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Fraud Prevention, Payments, and Financial Operations organizations to build scalable systems and operational tooling that support millions of users and transactions globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design thoughtful, intuitive experiences for Topps, Fanatics Live, and Fanatics Collect across web and mobile products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate product requirements, user needs, and business objectives into user flows, wireframes, prototypes, and polished interface designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design process from early exploration and concept development through detailed design and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers and engineers to understand requirements, explore solutions, and bring experiences to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other designers to understand user problems and develop solutions within established product and design direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our Graphic Designer and creative partners to ensure product experiences feel connected to the visual identity and expression of each brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and contribute to established design systems, patterns, and interaction standards to create consistent experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use feedback, research, product insights, and data to iterate on designs and improve the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create prototypes and other design artifacts that help communicate ideas and facilitate collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design critiques, brainstorming sessions, product reviews, and cross-functional working sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering during implementation to help ensure the quality and intent of the design carries through to the final experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage assigned projects and priorities while communicating progress, questions, and potential challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay curious about emerging patterns and trends across product design, mobile experiences, social platforms, marketplaces, live commerce, sports, and collecting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in product design, UX/UI design, interaction design, or a related digital design discipline through professional work, internships, freelance projects, or other relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating your product design process and ability to solve user experience and interface design problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundations in visual and interaction design, including layout, typography, hierarchy, usability, and responsive design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with designing digital experiences for web and/or mobile applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Figma or similar product design and prototyping tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of user-centered design principles and an interest in developing deeper product design expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take a defined problem or set of requirements and explore thoughtful design solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and an openness to feedback and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate design ideas and explain the thinking behind your decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative approach and enthusiasm for working closely with product, engineering, design, and creative partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance multiple assignments and priorities in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and a desire to continue learning and developing your craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in sports, collectibles, entertainment, community, live commerce, or digital marketplaces is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Work With the Creative Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great fan experiences require both strong products and strong brands. In this role, you’ll work closely with designers and creative partners to help connect the two.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll focus primarily on how digital experiences work—understanding user needs, defining flows and interactions, designing interfaces, and collaborating with product and engineering teams to bring those experiences to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with our &lt;strong&gt;Graphic Designer&lt;/strong&gt;, who helps shape how our brands and campaigns visually come to life across marketing, content, and other fan-facing touchpoints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, you’ll help create experiences that are intuitive, visually compelling, and distinctly Fanatics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to Los Angeles and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$95,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Product Designer III to design the collector-facing experiences delivered by the Collector Engagement team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This designer will partner closely with Product, Engineering and Brand to design how collectors discover, understand, progress through and complete programs — spanning progression and quest experiences, redemption and reward flows, leaderboards, and check-in moments in retail and live event environments. These are mechanics-heavy experiences governed by real rules and real rewards, so the core craft challenge is making complex systems immediately legible without losing the moments that make collecting exciting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, prototype and deliver end-to-end experiences for assigned collector programs, from flows and wireframes through production-ready UI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the collector-facing surfaces where progress across multiple concurrent programs must coexist without overwhelming the collector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make rules-based mechanics understandable, including eligibility, progress state, reward tiers, expiry, and the paths where a collector does not qualify&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the physical-to-digital handoff, including card scanning and check-in moments that occur in poor lighting, on constrained connections, and in crowded environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and extend reusable components and patterns for program surfaces so that each new program is assembled from existing building blocks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate daily with frontend engineers on feasibility, interaction states, motion and handoff, and stay engaged through implementation review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product on program mechanics, contributing to what a program is and not only how it is presented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to accessibility, localization readiness, and consistency across collector-facing surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate designs with collectors and against program telemetry, and iterate on the results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to design critique and support quality across the broader design team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with consumer mobile design patterns and apply relevant advancements to collector experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional product design experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio demonstrating shipped consumer mobile work, with clear ownership of end-to-end flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong range from ambiguous problem definition through flows, interaction detail, and polished, engineering-ready UI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing rules-based or state-heavy experiences such as progression, loyalty, wallets, or marketplaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Figma, including building and maintaining components and variables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within and contributing to an established design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of mobile interaction patterns, accessibility fundamentals, and platform conventions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to present and defend design decisions to Product and Engineering partners, and to revise them in response to new information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills within cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English, with daily collaboration across US-based stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Design, Human-Computer Interaction, or related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing gamified systems, quests, achievements, or progression mechanics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for physical-to-digital interactions such as scanning, QR or NFC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion and prototyping skills for communicating reward, unlock and reveal moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for live events, venues, or retail environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with design tokens and multi-surface component libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for sports, collectibles, creators, or digital communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires strong hands-on product design expertise. Designers at this level are expected to independently deliver production-ready designs for assigned programs, contribute to the component library and pattern decisions that support them, and maintain high standards for usability, consistency and craft quality consistent with role expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As part of Fanatics Collectibles’ continued global growth, we are establishing a new technology hub in Mexico City focused on operational excellence, platform scalability, trust, and customer experience. This team partners closely with Customer Experience (CX), Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Fraud Prevention, Payments, and Financial Operations organizations to build scalable systems and operational tooling that support millions of users and transactions globally.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fanatics Collectibles (and Topps) has long been an innovator in the card manufacturing industry. We offer our customers a comprehensive mix of special effects finishing, collation, and packaging techniques to make even the most challenging of projects come to life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Innovation Project Manager, the Product Innovation Associate will support the development and execution of the product innovation agenda. The Associate will research technologies that could improve performance, reduce cost, or enhance the consumer experience, and will work alongside operations and support teams to coordinate potential projects and help deliver expected results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General Duties and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Assist in identifying and developing innovative new products, platforms, and processes aligned to market and business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support test projects from planning through completion, working with teams across the organization to help ensure objectives meet standards for quality, repeatability, and scalability for required production quantities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Provide regular project updates to the Innovation Project Manager, and other cross-functional stakeholders, escalating risks and challenges as appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Analyze data and market trends to generate insights that support the innovation process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Schedule, prepare for, and participate in Product Innovation meetings; facilitate portions of meetings as assigned.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Research options for materials and equipment needs for individual innovations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support engagement with outside vendors on technology and execution needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with internal departments on technology needs and project requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support trials of new technologies across applicable processes to help identify potential failure points within the manufacturing process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Document processes, order of operations, test results, and materials for each innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Maintain an organized library of new technologies, innovations, and related documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Assist with problem solving technical challenges experienced during manufacturing processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education, Experience and Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelors’ degree in design or engineering and/or equivalent work experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;1-3 years of experience in pre-press, design, print, print finishing, manufacturing, or related production environments preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Exposure to project management, Lean, Six Sigma, continuous improvement, or business analysis principles preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;1-3 years of operations, manufacturing, product development, or related experience preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;English language domain (bilingual with Spanish a plus).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience collaborating with or coordinating across multifunctional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Curiosity and a problem-solving mindset, with the ability to support project plans, timelines, and roadmaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Job Knowledge, Skills and Abilities:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Demonstrates analytical skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with project management tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Highly organized with excellent time management abilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to organize and prioritize multiple assignments or project workstreams as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to build positive working relationships with colleagues, stakeholders, and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively and influence outcomes through clear communication and follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently as well as a member of a project or operational team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Results-oriented, with developing project coordination and project management skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced environment and plan work according to business requirements and deadlines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Self-driven, curious, and willing to seek out learning opportunities and take initiative within assigned responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
