&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Senior Manager, Strategic Ops – Fanatics Collectibles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company working at the intersection of collectibles and technology.&amp;nbsp; We are backed by some of the best investors, sports &amp;amp; entertainment properties, and operators in the world.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics Collectibles is integrating with Fanatics’ global digital sports platform – which includes 900 sports relationships and 81+ million reachable fans – to reimagine the collectibles business for the 21st century.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is looking for a seasoned leader to own some of the highest priority, highest complexity, and highest visibility initiatives on our organization’s strategic manufacturing &amp;amp; operations roadmap. The Senior Manager will report directly to the Sr Director, Strategic Ops who reports directly to Collectibles’ EVP Operations. Given the team’s end-to-end mandate, this role will be expected to 1) own the evaluation / scoping / strategic analysis of potential operations initiatives as well as 2) to drive end-to-end execution and ultimately ensure value capture. The ideal candidate is a self-starter with world-class strategic &amp;amp; analytical skills, a demonstrated propensity for solving difficult problems, experience leading and growing teams, and a clear team-first mindset. Candidates with a passion for sports, culture, &amp;amp; entertainment will find themselves a strong cultural fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Within the first 6 months, you will…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own multiple high-impact business initiatives simultaneously and work cross-functionally to ensure executional / strategic success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set goals, drive large programs &amp;amp; analytics, present progress updates, and deliver recommendations to the executive leadership, VPs, &amp;amp; cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with BizOps, Manufacturing, Project Management, Finance, Pre-Press, and Operations teams to identify, size, and actively prioritize all potential initiatives / opportunities on the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lend cross-functional support by leading / driving highly impactful, analytical, and strategic initiatives across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Exec-Level analysis &amp;amp; recommendations to support strategic initiatives, offsites, and long-term planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with a wide array of end-consumers and channel partners to further Collectibles’ knowledge base and thought leadership within the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Ideal Candidate:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dallas / Sunnyvale, TX based (Can also work a mix across our other offices in Coppell/Allen) OR willingness to relocate to Dallas/Sunnyvale if in another market currently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years of experience, with a preference for Management Consulting, Manufacturing, Strategy, Finance / Accounting, or Biz Ops / Strategy roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in finance, business, economics, accounting or similar. MBA Preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative modelling &amp;amp; analytical skills, excellent written &amp;amp; verbal communication skills, strong financial acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-first management mindset, with a passion for solving highly complex problems collaboratively with their direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior project management skills, with ability to apply a structured approach across multiple, highly complex, cross-functional projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong intellectual horsepower; superior reasoning and analytical skills, proven track record of translating insights into actionable strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud. Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants. Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @&lt;a href=&quot;http://collectfanatics.com&quot;&gt;collectfanatics.com&lt;/a&gt;). For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
