&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager, Supply Chain Technology&lt;/strong&gt; to build the products and technology that enable a scalable, connected, and efficient global supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll define product strategy and roadmaps for technology that helps our teams plan effectively, improve inventory and operational visibility, streamline workflows, and move products through the supply chain with greater speed and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Supply Chain, Operations, Engineering, Finance, and Product, you’ll turn complex operational challenges into scalable technology solutions. Success means creating products that make our supply chain more efficient, resilient, and easier to operate as Fanatics Collectibles continues to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product strategy and roadmaps for key Supply Chain Technology capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with supply chain teams to identify operational challenges and opportunities where technology can drive meaningful improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build products that improve planning, inventory visibility, operational workflows, and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate manual processes, connect fragmented systems and data, and simplify complex workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer and business needs into clear product requirements and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering throughout discovery, development, launch, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance immediate operational needs with longer-term platform investments and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics and use data and customer feedback to measure impact and guide product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align cross-functional stakeholders around priorities, tradeoffs, and technology investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience building and owning complex software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience defining product strategy, prioritizing roadmaps, and delivering measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with engineering teams to build enterprise software, operational technology, or workflow solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex operational problems and translate them into intuitive, scalable products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, communication, and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate ambiguity, independently prioritize competing opportunities, and drive decisions with limited guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of product discovery, prioritization, delivery, and lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with supply chain, inventory management, planning, logistics, fulfillment, warehouse operations, or related technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with supply chain planning, inventory, order management, warehouse management, or transportation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building workflow automation, operational visibility, exception management, or decision-support products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating enterprise platforms and build-versus-buy decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in consumer products, commerce, collectibles, retail, or another operationally complex industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants. Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to New York City and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NYC Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$155,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$193,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

