&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fanatics Collectibles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is the home of sports cards, trading cards, and collectibles for over 100 million fans worldwide. As part of the global Fanatics platform, we&#39;re rebuilding how collectors discover, buy, sell, and experience their hobby with world class technology and product experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Fanatics Collectibles’ continued global growth, we are establishing a new technology hub in Mexico City focused on operational excellence, platform scalability, trust, and customer experience. This team partners closely with Customer Experience (CX), Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Fraud Prevention, Payments, and Financial Operations organizations to build scalable systems and operational tooling that support millions of users and transactions globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will lead the design and delivery of scalable operational systems that support Customer Experience, Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Fraud Prevention, and Financial Operations across Fanatics Collectibles’ global platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design and implementation of scalable operational platforms and backend services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect systems supporting customer operations, fraud detection workflows, dispute management, payment operations, and trust tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical initiatives that improve automation, operational efficiency, reliability, and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Data, CX Operations, Compliance, and Finance stakeholders to define technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve system observability, resiliency, monitoring, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical investigations, root-cause analysis, and incident response efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through code reviews, design reviews, and technical coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive engineering standards, development processes, and technical best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing scalable distributed systems and backend platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Python, Java, Kotlin, or Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with AWS cloud-native architectures and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven systems and service integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Code-Writing Contribution&lt;br&gt;Senior Software Engineers are expected to design and implement complex backend systems, influence architectural direction through hands-on technical leadership, and deliver scalable, maintainable production code.&lt;/p&gt;
