&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The standard 40-hour work week is the goal with this role. However, this role is needed to work beyond these hours, especially if there are safety incidents, inspections, or training sessions that require attention. In our industry, this role is expected to be available during shift changes and weekends to ensure compliance, as needed, with safety regulations. Flexibility is key in this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
