&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Topps Digital&lt;/strong&gt;, part of &lt;strong&gt;Fanatics Collectibles&lt;/strong&gt;, creates premium digital collectible experiences across some of the world&#39;s most recognizable sports and entertainment brands. &lt;strong&gt;Our Game Art team creates the art, animation, and visual effects that bring our digital collectibles to life.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Unity Game Artist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Game Art team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with Product Managers, UI/UX Designers, Engineers, and QA, bringing a creative and technical perspective to feature decisions. You&#39;ll transform concepts, 2D and 3D artwork, and Figma designs into polished, production-ready features in Unity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build features ranging from card reveals and pack openings to UI animation and visual effects. &amp;nbsp;As a member of the team, you&#39;ll raise the creative and technical bar, lead feature implementation, and drive improvements to our production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead feature implementation by identifying blockers, coordinating across disciplines, and communicating risks early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide creative and technical input, identifying opportunities to improve designs, animation, visual effects, and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and maintain the creative and technical quality bar for the Game Art team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor fellow Game Artists through feedback, reviews, and day-to-day collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement approved designs in Unity while collaborating throughout development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and implement polished 2D and 3D assets, animation, visual effects, and interactive UI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain Unity prefabs, Timelines, shaders, particle systems, and reusable UI components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable Unity systems that can scale across multiple apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize assets and visual effects for mobile performance and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own art implementation through development, QA, and live releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements to Game Art documentation, tooling, and production workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the use of AI and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of professional experience creating and implementing &lt;strong&gt;2D and 3D assets&lt;/strong&gt; for shipped mobile games or other interactive applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Unity UI, Animation, Timeline, Prefabs, Particle Systems, and production workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, After Effects)&lt;/strong&gt; and 3D content creation tools such as &lt;strong&gt;Blender&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Maya&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong artistic fundamentals, including animation, motion, composition, lighting, and visual storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create polished UI animation and visual effects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of optimization techniques for mobile performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills in a fast-paced, cross-functional development environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to mentor artists and lead feature implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail with excellent communication, organization, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Jira&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Figma and design systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating custom shaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background improving art pipelines and development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with C# scripting in Unity to support implementation and collaboration with engineers is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Game Art works closely with UI/UX Designers, Product Managers, Engineers, and QA throughout development. We believe the best work comes from early collaboration, frequent iteration, and shared ownership. We&#39;re continually improving our pipeline, driving automation and AI to streamline development and give artists more time to focus on creativity and polish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on world-class sports and entertainment brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a passionate, multidisciplinary team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of digital collectibles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, comprehensive benefits, and opportunities for growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;USA Remote Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$95,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Visual Production Designer to create high-quality digital assets across Topps.com and Fanatics Collect. You will translate brand systems, creative concepts, and product stories into polished work across ecommerce, app, lifecycle, and marketing touchpoints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role for a designer who combines strong visual judgment with speed, precision, and thoughtful production craft. You will champion our brand guidelines while finding compelling ways to bring each product to life, highlighting its story, collectibility, key cards, athletes, artists, and cultural context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across a wide range of formats, maintain consistency at scale, and help every asset feel intentional, distinctly on-brand, and appropriate for the channel where it appears.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you will do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and produce digital assets for Topps.com and Fanatics Collect, including site banners, landing page modules, product storytelling, promotional placements, in-app content, email, paid media, and social formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring product releases to life through visual storytelling that highlights their unique themes, subjects, cards, inserts, athletes, and collector appeal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and consistently apply Topps and Fanatics Collect brand guidelines across every touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve production standards, templates, and best practices as the brands and digital experiences continue to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend approved creative direction across multiple sizes, channels, sports, entertainment properties, and product releases without losing the quality or intent of the original concept.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build clear visual hierarchy around trading cards, products, athletes, entertainment properties, offers, and calls to action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use composition, typography, imagery, pacing, and content hierarchy to make complex product stories easy to understand and exciting to explore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare production-ready files and deliver accurate exports that meet platform, accessibility, localization, and technical requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable templates and modular systems that make recurring asset production faster and more consistent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retouch, composite, resize, and optimize product and card imagery while maintaining premium image quality and accurate product representation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with brand designers, product designers, copywriters, marketers, merchandisers, producers, and developers from brief through final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage several concurrent requests, respond to feedback, and communicate timing, dependencies, and risks clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized source files, naming conventions, version control, and asset libraries so work can be easily reused and handed off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas that improve the craft, efficiency, storytelling, and consistency of our production process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 3–5 years of experience in visual design, digital production design, marketing design, ecommerce, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating strong typography, layout, image composition, color, hierarchy, and attention to detail across digital formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Examples of using visual design to communicate a product story, not simply displaying a product or adapting campaign assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Figma and Adobe Creative Suite, especially Photoshop and Illustrator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within and championing established brand guidelines across a wide range of channels and formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to maintain brand consistency while making thoughtful creative decisions that respond to the specific product, audience, and placement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong image editing, compositing, retouching, and file-preparation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of responsive web design and how creative assets behave across desktop and mobile experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization and quality-control habits, including careful review of copy, crops, alignment, image resolution, and export specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a fast-moving environment with overlapping launches, feedback cycles, and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and a collaborative, low-ego approach to the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for ecommerce, marketplaces, consumer apps, sports, entertainment, collectibles, or culture-driven brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating editorial or content-led digital experiences that connect products to broader stories, people, and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of motion design and tools such as After Effects or Rive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with content management systems and designing modular assets for repeatable publishing workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with accessibility standards and performance considerations for web and app imagery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in trading cards, collecting, sports, or fandom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You consistently deliver polished, accurate work across a high volume of requests. Your files are organized, your assets feel native to each channel, and your attention to detail raises the quality of Topps.com and Fanatics Collect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You become a trusted champion of the brand, helping ensure that every execution feels cohesive while giving individual products a distinctive and compelling story. Over time, you help the team move faster and create stronger work by improving templates, production standards, storytelling approaches, and reusable visual systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;How we work&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care about the details collectors notice: the quality of a card image, the clarity of a product story, the consistency of a system, and the polish of every interaction. We work collaboratively, move quickly, and expect designers to balance creative craft with practical execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to Los Angeles and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$70,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$85,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is building the future of trading card games. The Fanatics TCG studio is focused on creating the next generation of global trading card game franchises — combining compelling intellectual property, innovative gameplay, premium collectible objects, and deeply engaged communities. Our ambition is to build TCG ecosystems that reach millions of players and collectors worldwide and grow into multi-billion-dollar entertainment businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Vice President, Commercial to lead the commercial strategy and business development for Fanatics TCG. This leader will be responsible for building and scaling the commercial infrastructure behind our games and IP — including distribution, retail strategy, and ecosystem growth. This role will partner closely with studio and sales/commercial leadership across product, design, marketing, and community to translate creative vision into successful global franchises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines deep commercial experience in gaming, collectibles, or entertainment with a strong strategic mindset and the ability to scale new businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Commercial Strategy for the TCG Studio&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and lead the global commercial strategy for Fanatics TCG franchises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop revenue models that support long-term franchise growth across physical, digital, and experiential channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with studio leadership to translate product roadmaps into scalable businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Lead the Commercial Organization&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the commercial team for the TCG studio, including functions such as partnerships, licensing, distribution strategy, and retail programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the processes, partnerships, and infrastructure required to support global growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally across Fanatics Collectibles and the broader Fanatics ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distribution, Retail &amp;amp; Market Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop global strategies across hobby retail, mass retail, direct-to-consumer, and international distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Fanatics sales and commerce teams to optimize product launches and channel strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand the reach of TCG franchises into new markets and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-To-Market Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee commercial planning for major product launches and franchise initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with marketing and product teams to deliver cohesive global launch strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and market insights to refine pricing, packaging, and product strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem &amp;amp; Community Growth&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of thriving player and collector communities through events, organized play, and community programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify commercial opportunities that strengthen long-term engagement and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build sustainable franchise ecosystems that grow over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in gaming, trading cards, collectibles, licensing, entertainment, or related industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building and scaling commercial businesses or product ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in partnerships, licensing, distribution, or commercial strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of gaming, hobby retail, or fandom-driven markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional teams and operating in high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic thinking combined with the ability to execute at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with trading card games, tabletop games, or digital gaming ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching or scaling global consumer franchises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with community-driven or live service product ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHY JOIN FANATICS TCG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is building the future of fandom. The Fanatics TCG studio represents a rare opportunity to help create entirely new trading card game universes — backed by the scale, infrastructure, and reach of the Fanatics ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Vice President, Commercial&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a central role in building the commercial engine behind the next generation of global TCG franchises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about shaping the future of trading card games and helping build enduring entertainment ecosystems, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. When determining base pay as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training.&amp;nbsp;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$285,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$315,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collect is a global product and technology group dedicated to revolutionizing the world of collectibles. Every single day our team of experienced product leaders, engineers, and operators obsesses over how to create the ultimate collector experience with our products: Topps.com, the direct to consumer ecommerce platform of the Topps brand, Fanatics Collect, the most trusted and dynamic collector focused marketplace, and our collector focused live shopping platforms, Fanatics Live and Voggt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;We have the unique advantage of being backed by Fanatics - the world’s largest sports merchandiser, with more than 900 global sports relationships, 90+ million reachable fans, and exclusive licensing deals with the MLB, NFL, and NBA among many others - but we’re a nimble, ambitious team building products from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about building world class products and share our love for sports fans and collectors, Fanatics Collect offers an exciting opportunity to be part of a dynamic team creating the future of collecting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collect is seeking a strategic and analytical Vice President of Growth &amp;amp; Demand Systems to architect the next phase of sustainable growth across our collector ecosystem. This is a highly cross-functional leadership role focused on building scalable growth systems—not managing traditional marketing channels. You will partner closely with Product, Engineering, Commercial, Data Science, Analytics, and Growth teams to develop frameworks, experimentation capabilities, and operating models that drive activation, engagement, retention, monetization, and long-term collector value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has experience scaling a complex marketplace, fintech, or consumer technology platform through rapid growth and understands how product innovation, experimentation, data, and network effects combine to create durable competitive advantages. This leader will establish the operating systems that transform growth into a repeatable, measurable, and scalable capability across the Fanatics Collect ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead the growth operating system, including planning frameworks, measurement systems, experimentation processes, and operating cadences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to embed growth strategies throughout the collector experience, improving activation, engagement, retention, referrals, monetization, and cross-platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale ecosystem growth loops that connect products and experiences across the Fanatics Collect platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a best-in-class experimentation culture through A/B testing, incrementality measurement, cohort analysis, behavioral segmentation, retention modeling, marketplace analytics, and growth forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable frameworks to identify, prioritize, and measure high-impact growth opportunities across multiple products and business lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Analytics and Data Science teams to improve decision-making through data-driven insights and predictive modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a strategic partner to Product, Commercial, Growth, and Data leadership, driving alignment and influencing cross-functional priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and monitor the key collector behaviors that contribute to long-term customer value and ecosystem participation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of continuous experimentation, learning, and operational excellence across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a high-performing growth organization capable of supporting the company&#39;s long-term strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Marketing, Engineering, Computer Science, Economics, or a related field; MBA or advanced degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive leadership experience in Growth, Product Growth, Marketplace Growth, Growth Strategy, or related disciplines within consumer technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success scaling high-growth marketplace, fintech, ecommerce, SaaS, or consumer technology platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of product-led growth, customer lifecycle management, activation, engagement, retention, monetization, referral systems, and network effects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience partnering with Product and Engineering organizations to build growth capabilities directly into digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in experimentation methodologies, A/B testing, analytics, forecasting, behavioral segmentation, and data-driven decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building scalable operating frameworks, growth systems, and high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical, strategic thinking, and problem-solving skills with the ability to translate complex data into actionable business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication and stakeholder management skills with a proven ability to influence across cross-functional organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern analytics, experimentation, and business intelligence platforms is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants. Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to Los Angeles and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$224,250&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$286,350 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to New York City and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NYC Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$243,750&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$311,250 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fanatics TCG is a new Seattle-based trading card game studio within the Fanatics Collectibles family, founded by industry veterans with a long-term mandate: to build enduring franchises that live across tabletop, digital, community, and culture. We&#39;re looking for the most skilled and passionate talent in the games industry and beyond to help us create the best TCGs in the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the Vice President of TCG Publishing, you are responsible for building the capabilities that turn great games into lasting ecosystems: defining how Fanatics TCG launches and supports trading card games; overseeing how players interact with our games through play; and shaping the digital and community infrastructure that connects players to our games and to each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define the long-term go-to-market strategy for Fanatics TCG, including how we launch, live-support, and steward games over their full lifecycle. Your team will be responsible for release planning, set lifecycle management, and player communication cadence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the strategic direction of organized play across the portfolio, from store-level events through regional and premier competition, including judge programs, prize support philosophy, qualification structures, and the balance between competitive and casual play that sustains long-term ecosystem health.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Architect and scale the player-facing digital ecosystem, including companion apps, deckbuilders, collection tools, rules references, and the play clients that extend our games beyond the table.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build the player-identity and community infrastructure that connects players to us and to each other across titles: accounts, cross-title player identity, community platforms, creator and influencer programs, and the publishing voice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify where Fanatics&#39; existing trading-card publishing capabilities translate to TCG, and navigate the differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Align cross-functional partners across Studios, Commercial, Retail, Product, Marketing, Operations, and Finance to ensure cohesive execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build and lead a small, senior, high-leverage team responsible for digital product, organized play, publishing operations, and community and player relations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;12-18+ years in senior publishing, product, or operating leadership roles, ideally in TCG, gaming, or closely adjacent hobby categories. Strong publishing leaders from adjacent categories with the appetite and humility to learn TCG-specific craft fast will also be considered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A genuine product mind for player-facing software, not just an operational one. Holds their own with digital product leaders on roadmap, prioritization, and what makes a companion product loved versus tolerated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A builder and systems thinker who creates repeatable capabilities – focused on scale and sustained outcomes rather than launch by launch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in white space – defining functions that don&#39;t yet exist, drawing boundaries with peers in real time, and making calls without complete information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong commercial and analytical literacy; speaks fluently with P&amp;amp;L owners without owning the P&amp;amp;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Player respect as a core operating value, with excellent instincts about what serves the player base over a ten-year horizon, and the willingness to advocate for them in rooms focused on shorter time scales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Senior leadership experience inside a major TCG publisher&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing or running organized play programs at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Background in hybrid physical + digital ecosystems or marketplace businesses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with licensing, IP partnerships, or entertainment ecosystems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in high-growth consumer or digital commerce environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for trading card games, gaming, and fan culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All employees of Fanatics TCG are expected to be onsite in our Seattle office five days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants. Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to Seattle and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Seattle Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$224,250&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$286,350 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics TCG is a new Seattle-based trading card game studio within the Fanatics Collectibles family, founded by industry veterans with a long-term mandate: to build enduring franchises that live across tabletop, digital, community, and culture. We&#39;re looking for the most skilled and passionate talent in the games industry and beyond to help us create the best trading card games in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a visionary executive leader for our second flagship trading card game. You&#39;ve built worlds and shipped games before - and you&#39;ve seen what separates the franchises that last from the ones that just launch. As VP of Trading Card Games, you’re accountable to the game’s creative vision, design integrity, and commercial success. You are a highly effective leader across disciplines, with sharp business instincts and a keen sense of what makes a franchise endure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the creative and product vision for a game franchise, from core game design and world-building through set architecture, long-range franchise roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the final decision-maker on what ships, balancing creative ambition, player experience, and business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the franchise development plan, optimizing for long-term ecosystem health: multi-year set pipeline, milestone structure, resourcing, and the tradeoffs required to keep a sustained release cadence with minimal impact to quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, print operations, and commercial leadership on rarity architecture, product configuration, and manufacturing constraints, translating between creative intent and physical execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share accountability for the franchise&#39;s commercial performance, partnering with commercial and finance leadership on forecasting, product mix, and long-range planning, and making creative decisions with a clear view of their business consequences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the VP of Publishing on launch strategy, live support, and organized play so that how the game is played and supported reflects how it was designed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the franchise to studio and Fanatics leadership - articulating vision, progress, risk, and the case for investment with clarity and conviction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a public voice for the game with players, retail partners, creators, and the broader hobby ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in games, including significant time leading a title or franchise as an Executive Producer, Studio Head, GM, or equivalent single-owner role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of a game that shipped and sustained&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep craft credibility with creative and design leaders. You may come from design, production, or creative direction, but you hold your own in a mechanics debate and know the difference between a real design problem and a preference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping on a recurring cadence (live service, seasonal, or set-based)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in white space. You&#39;re joining a studio that is still defining itself, and you&#39;ll be drawing boundaries with peers in real time and making calls without complete information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine respect for players as a core operating value, with the instincts and the spine to advocate for the long-term health of the game in rooms focused on shorter time scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and stakeholder management skills across creative, commercial, and executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a trading card game, tabletop game, or hybrid physical + digital franchise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the operational realities of physical product: manufacturing lead times, print planning, and the constraints they impose on creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up a studio or a new franchise from early stage through launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background with organized play, competitive communities, or long-lived player ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on participation in the hobby, with the feel for play, value, and fandom that comes from time spent inside it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for trading card games, collectibles, and fan culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All employees of Fanatics TCG are expected to be onsite in our Seattle office five days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including @collectfanatics.com).&amp;nbsp; For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. &amp;nbsp;This salary range is specific to Seattle and may not be applicable to other locations. &amp;nbsp;When determining base pay, as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training. For information about our benefits, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Seattle Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$258,750&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$328,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

